 and let the user stop you. Reads need no confirmation.\n\nNever write to a platform the user did not ask you to touch. Pulling a contact from HubSpot is not permission to update it.\n","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"no confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-fadbdd012b9a4b428e196135d712ac38"],"id":"sha256:4e10b6fb05eb274a1341dcac92500a262073ca9fd6d2a5cdbdbc2b023a1e0143","intent":null,"line":47,"match_fingerprint":"8d917baac03779a421e90f894620a765c8fd0787d50e2d8abf3d4267050d15a4","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-fadbdd012b9a4b428e196135d712ac38","line":47,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":298}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":298,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"plugin:community:639c4dad05362f7d7913418d89864624/one-integrations","kind":"plugin_skill","plugin_path":"","profile":{"digest":"sha256:a73e7c4a9fa0ac563a885c541d207e90dde2e248ca426f7824cf429d725db921","id":"static-standard-v3"},"raw_finding_count":1,"report_digest":"sha256:2d2c5236bfc77c1bbdbeebb2aca344486c7569e89010f511fb31d93e2fb96425","retry":{"attempt_count":1,"disposition":"none","latest_status":"complete","next_attempt_at":null,"next_profile":null,"reason":"complete"},"scanned_at":"2026-10-31T12:45:18Z","scanner":{"id":"skillspector","revision":"f3b25697d76256998ca9d42c198d256258d4c035","version":"2.13.1"},"skill_name":"one-integrations","source":{"content_digest":"sha256:56c84562a278385963043e42846eb4dd047ea76dbedc73